bottomparticipants

actor Admin
boundary "Genre Management UI" as UI
boundary Router
control GenreController
control ValidationPipe
control GenreService
entity ":GenreModel" as GenreModel
database MongoDB

Admin -> UI: 1. Click "Update" on genre row
activate Admin
activate UI

Admin -> UI: 2. Modify fields + submit update

UI -> Router: 3. PATCH /genre/{id}
activate Router

Router -> Router: 4. Check token / role
activate Router
space
deactivate Router

alt Token invalid
    Router --> UI: 4.1.1 401 Unauthorized
    UI --> Admin: 4.1.2 Show error message
else Role invalid
    Router --> UI: 4.2.1 403 Forbidden
    UI --> Admin: 4.2.2 Show error message
end

Router -> GenreController: 5. update(id, dto)
activate GenreController

GenreController -> ValidationPipe: 6. Validate UpdateGenreDto
activate ValidationPipe

opt Validation failed
    ValidationPipe --> GenreController: 6.1 Throw 400 error
    GenreController --> Router: 6.2 HTTP 400 response
    Router --> UI: 6.3 Validation error
    UI --> Admin: 6.4 Show error message
end

ValidationPipe --> GenreController: 7. DTO valid
deactivate ValidationPipe

GenreController -> GenreService: 8. updateGenre(id, dto)
activate GenreService

GenreService -> GenreService: 9. Validate input
activate GenreService
space
deactivate GenreService

opt Invalid ObjectId
    GenreService --> GenreController: 9.1 BadRequestException
    GenreController --> Router: 9.2 HTTP 400 response
    Router --> UI: 9.3 Invalid ID error
    UI --> Admin: 9.4 Show error message
end

GenreService -> GenreModel: 10. findByIdAndUpdate(id, dto, {new:true})
activate GenreModel
GenreModel -> MongoDB: 11. Update document
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> GenreModel: 12. Return result
deactivate MongoDB
GenreModel --> GenreService: 13. Return result
deactivate GenreModel

GenreService -> GenreService: 14. Check update result
activate GenreService
space
deactivate GenreService

opt Not found
    GenreService --> GenreController: 14.1 NotFoundException
    GenreController --> Router: 14.2 HTTP 404 response
    Router --> UI: 14.3 Not found error
    UI --> Admin: 14.4 Show error message
end

GenreService --> GenreController: 15. Updated genre
deactivate GenreService

GenreController --> Router: 16. HTTP 200 response
deactivate GenreController

Router --> UI: 17. Return updated genre
deactivate Router

UI --> Admin: 18. Update success
deactivate UI
deactivate Admin